    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you gain the following benefits for 10 minutes or until you end them (no action required).</p><p><strong>Generate Runic Power.</strong> You can restore your use of Runic Mastery by expending a level 4 spell slot (no action required).</p><p><strong>Runeforging.</strong> When you use your Runic Power and Runic Mastery features, you can choose any effect, not just the one matching the rune on your weapon.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest, but you can restore it by expending a level 5 spell slot (no action required).</p>",
